  build.rs) copies the copy that the steamworks-sys version in Cargo.lock (0.13.0) ships (it matches that crate's
  bindings; the SDK 1.65 DLL in D:\LM\steamworks_sdk_165 lacks the SteamNetworkingSockets012 interface they
  import) next to redex.exe and redex-world.exe in target/<profile>/. redex.exe delay-loads it, so offline play
