  redex.exe and redex-world.exe, and nothing else from the SDK.

- Not shipped, not redistributable by us: steamclient64.dll, tier0_s64.dll and vstdlib_s64.dll, which the game
  server (SteamGameServer) loads. On a PC with the Steam client installed they come from it; a dedicated server
  without Steam gets them by installing Valve's SteamCMD and copying them from its folder beside redex-world.exe
  (Valve's documented setup). They are part of the Steam client / SteamCMD and fall under the Steam Subscriber
  Agreement, so the server operator installs them; we do not bundle them.

- App id 480 ("Spacewar") is Valve's public Steamworks test app. Using it is fine for development and testing;
  a public release should move to an app id of its own (Steam Direct). Nothing in our code depends on 480 beyond
  the APP_ID constants in redex-world/src/steam.rs and xr-net/src/steam.rs.
